      "text": "🤖 Bitcoin works Saturdays, so does GENESIS\n\nHonest framing.\n\nIt's Saturday. Gold is shut until the new week, so most of the market is resting. Bitcoin isn't. It trades every hour of the weekend, and so does TITAN GENESIS.\n\nWeekend Bitcoin used to look like this: refreshing the price in the queue at the shop, an alert you meant to check later, one rushed trade from the sofa late on Sunday.\n\nGENESIS just gets on with it. It watches BTCUSD all weekend, waits for its own rules to line up and places the trade itself, while you're at the gym, at lunch, or nowhere near a screen.\n\nYou get your Saturday back, and your account still works a shift.\n\nTITAN GENESIS comes with the Gold tier, and the robot is FREE. Tap the pin above, GET OUR EA, and it's yours 🤖.",
